gpp
    - rudimentary pre-processor for multi-version doc-files.

templant
    - C++ source modifying tool.  in-file macro expansion through templates.
      inline function management for outlining during development, inlining
      afterwards.

metadon
    - Meta documentation for Coin development (HTML formatted).

coin.el
    - Emacs Lisp functions to aid misc operations on the Coin code

ChangeLog.sh
    - automatically generate ChangeLog entries from cvs commit
      log-messages

install-dependencies.sh
    - installs development and CI dependencies using apt on Debian/Ubuntu,
      Homebrew on macOS, or an existing vcpkg installation on Windows.
      Run `scripts/install-dependencies.sh gl` before configuring with
      `-DCOIN_BUILD_GL_TESTS=ON`. The script does not install a package
      manager; Windows users must set VCPKG_ROOT or
      VCPKG_INSTALLATION_ROOT.
